🇺🇸 Nvidia Update: Jensen Huang Reinstated as CEO 

▪️Jensen Huang, after being targeted by a coordinated media attack, summoned by Congress, & tossed out of his own company, was reinstated with a "new frame of mind" & new staff installed to oversee "compliance" - a textbook shakedown;

▪️But remember when corners of the alt media claimed "Israel took Nvidia over," had "3 Israelis" lined up to take Jensen Huang's place & anyone who said otherwise was "defending Israel?" 

Unless Jensen Huang spent his time off acquiring Israeli citizenship, this is yet another example of how the US has used its proxies as scapegoats for US abuses;

▪️Material reality is based on money, power, industry, media influence, logistics - all the US has in abundance and Israel  depends on the US for. 

OBVIOUSLY Israel didn't take over Nvidia, but was  used as a willing scapegoat;

▪️As great of a learning opportunity this has been, the next time the US desires the public to believe "Israel did it! Not us!" it will likely still work.
